# Root-anchored on purpose. A bare `commands.md` also matched
# docs/src/brain/commands.md, a real docs page that SUMMARY.md links to, so it
# could never be committed and every clean build silently dropped the page from
# the book. Only the personal scratch notes at the root are ignored.
